## Mandatory pre-flight (AskQuestion only)

**Do not start any E2E step until all applicable questions are answered.** Use the **AskQuestion** tool; never substitute free-text guesses.

| Step | ID | When | Prompt | Options |
|------|-----|------|--------|---------|
| Q1 | `pm_e2e_env` | Always | Test environment | **`Local (docker roo)` — default** · `MP (Testing) — Chat API` (opt-in — remote APIs) · `MP (Testing) — PM chat UI` (opt-in — remote APIs) |
| Q2 | `pm_e2e_data_mode` | Always | Data source | **`Mock (local mp_mock)` — default when Local** · `Live MP APIs` (opt-in — calls testing MP) |
| Q3 | `pm_e2e_verify` | Always | Verification depth | **`GenSearch DB only` — default for classification bugs** · `DB + MP WO timeline` · `DB + MP + n8n (flow must be active)` |
| Q4 | `pm_e2e_wo` | Unless user supplied WO ids | Work order setup | `Use mock seed WO (default)` · `Use existing WO (user provides ids)` · `Create WO via mp-work-order API` (opt-in remote) · `Use CLIENT/LOCATION from .env.e2e.local` (opt-in remote) |
| Q5 | `pm_e2e_attachment_count` | Test case uses or may use file upload | How many PM attachments? | `0 (no files)` · `1` · `2` · `Use existing S3 URLs only (no upload)` |

**Branching after Q1–Q2:**

| Env | Data mode | Path |
|-----|-----------|------|
| **Local** | **Mock (default)** | `make mp-mock-e2e-up` → Chat API `localhost:8800` → verify GenSearch DB |
| Local | Live MP APIs (opt-in) | WO setup via remote APIs (if needed) → Chat API → verify GenSearch (+ MP if Q3) |
| MP (Testing) — Chat API | Live MP APIs | WO setup → `POST` testing chat API → verify DB + MP |
| MP (Testing) — PM chat UI | Live MP APIs | WO setup → browser PM chat → verify DB + MP |
| MP (Testing) | Mock | **Blocked** — choose `Local` + Mock or Live MP APIs |

**Attachment uploads (Q5 > 0, opt-in):** follow **`.cursor/y-generative-search/y-generative-search-rules/marketplace/y-upload-photo.mdc`** (`AWS_S3_BUCKET_PATH=docs-dev/pmroo/`) — hits real S3; prefer Q5=`0` for local-only runs. Attach metadata in `messages[].meta_data.attachments` per **.cursor/y-generative-search/y-generative-search-rules/pmroo/y-pmroo-chat-api-payload.mdc**.

