## PMRoo pipeline (what you are testing)

```text
PM message → POST /chat/api/chat (user_type=property_manager)
          → LLM + pm-action-request-context skill
          → register_pm_requests (0–N times)
          → GenSearch pm_action_requests rows (status=pending → proceed)
          → n8n v2.4 (if active, remote opt-in) → MP tChatMessages / email
```

**Ingress for PMRoo E2E is always Chat API** (or PM Web UI on remote opt-in, which calls the same API). Do **not** use RabbitMQ for standard PMRoo runs.

