## Environment variables

### Local mock (default)

- GenSearch DB: **`POSTGRES_DB_*`** from repo **`.env`**
- No **`MARKETPLACE_JWT`** required for local chat (`ENVIRONMENT=dev` in smoke overlay)
- Mock WO ids from **`cursor_workspace/e2e_seed`** (seeded by `make mp-mock-seed` from [`mp_mock/fixtures/example/`](../../../mp_mock/fixtures/example/))

### Remote opt-in

Load **`.env.e2e.local` (repo root)** (never print secrets). See **.cursor/y-generative-search/y-generative-search-rules/pmroo/y-pmroo-chat-api-payload.mdc** for required keys.

### Chat API hosts

| Target | Base URL | When |
|--------|----------|------|
| **Local docker (default)** | `http://localhost:8800` (`docker-compose.dev.yml`) | Default PMRoo E2E |
| Local (alt) | `http://localhost:8000` (`docker-compose.yml`) | If using non-dev compose |
| Testing remote (opt-in) | `https://api-testing-marketplace.vendoroo.ai` | Q1 = MP Testing only |

Local dev skips auth middleware when `ENVIRONMENT=development` or `dev`. Remote **always** needs `Authorization: Bearer …` or `meta_data.auth_bearer`.

### `VENDOROO_BASE_API_URL` (WO lookup inside register_pm_requests)

Same switch as ResiRoo — see `.cursor/y-generative-search/y-generative-search-rules/test/y-tst-e2e-resiroo.mdc` § Environment variables. For mock: **`make mp-mock-e2e-up`** / **`make mp-mock-e2e-off`**. Do **not** edit **`.env`** for mock mode.

