## Work order data

**Unless the user supplies verified WO data, do not invent ids.**

| Situation | Action |
|-----------|--------|
| **Default (mock)** | Use seed WO from `cursor_workspace/e2e_seed` — e.g. `clientId=198`, `woNumber=158220-1`, `jobToken=E2E-MOCK-158220`, `workOrderId=158220` |
| **Live APIs (opt-in)** | `.cursor/y-generative-search/y-generative-search-rules/marketplace/y-mp-work-order.mdc` or reuse WO from MP Testing UI — **do not invoke unless Q2 = Live MP APIs** |
| **PMRoo does not need ForceResiroo** | Create WO only — **no** Start Resiroo step (unlike ResiRoo) |
| **User-supplied WO** | Require numeric `workOrderId`, `woNumber`, `jobToken`, verified `clientId` |

Capture **`work_order_number`**, **`job_token`**, **`client_id`** for `meta_data` — see payload rule.

