## Local + mock + Chat API (default path)

### Preconditions

1. **Postgres** (GenSearch) and **Redis** running: `docker compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml up -d postgres redis`
2. **`make mp-mock-e2e-up`** — mock MP + `roo` / `roo-worker` pointed at `mp-mock`
3. **Fresh `session_id` per trial** (critical — developer WO context injects only on empty memory)

### Request shape

Build payloads per **.cursor/y-generative-search/y-generative-search-rules/pmroo/y-pmroo-chat-api-payload.mdc** (local mock section).

### Steps

1. `POST http://localhost:8800/chat/api/chat` with `stream: false`
2. Inspect **response JSON**: tool calls / assistant text — **do not use Langfuse** for local pass/fail
3. Verify GenSearch per **.cursor/y-generative-search/y-generative-search-rules/pmroo/y-pmroo-verify-register-pm-requests.mdc** (Layer 1–2)
4. **`make mp-mock-e2e-off`** when the run (or trial batch) is complete

### Statistical runs (flaky LLM)

For classification bugs, **N ≥ 10–20** trials per scenario with **new `session_id` each time**. Report `pass_count/total`. Stay on localhost for all trials.

