## Opt-in only (remote) — MP (Testing) + Live MP APIs

Use only when the user explicitly chose Q1 = MP Testing and Q2 = Live MP APIs.

### Chat API path

1. Load **`.env.e2e.local`**
2. Create or reuse WO (Q4) via `.cursor/y-generative-search/y-generative-search-rules/marketplace/y-mp-work-order.mdc` if needed
3. `POST https://api-testing-marketplace.vendoroo.ai/chat/api/chat` with **`MARKETPLACE_JWT`** as bearer (see payload rule)
4. Verify DB + MP timeline per verify rule

### PM chat UI path

1. Open **`MARKETPLACE_URL`** from **`.env.e2e.local`**, log in as PM test user
2. Open target WO workspace (`request-id=` / job token)
3. Send scenario message(s) in PMRoo chat panel
4. Capture **`session_id`** from DevTools / network if possible; else correlate via `pm_action_requests` by time + `user_id`
5. Verify DB + MP timeline

**n8n:** Testing flow **`GenChat Action Requests V2.4 [Test]`** may be **inactive** — if Q3 includes n8n, confirm with ops or use a personal duplicate workflow before expecting MP posts.

Full WO → MP comment E2E requires **Live MP APIs + active n8n** (remote opt-in only).

