## Pass / fail — register_pm_requests (VAP-2752 family)

Use **.cursor/y-generative-search/y-generative-search-rules/pmroo/y-pmroo-verify-register-pm-requests.mdc** for SQL and MP checks.

| Scenario | Pass |
|----------|------|
| **Context only** | 1 row, `type=Context Capture` |
| **Action only** | 1 row, `type=Action Request` |
| **Mixed intent** | **2 rows** — CC **then** AR (lower `id` = CC); **`quoted_messages` differ** per half |
| **Policy / question** | 0 `register_pm_requests` when skill says answer in chat / policy path |
| **"yes" after confirm** | No extra CC/AR beyond what mixed flow already registered |

**Fail examples:**

- Same full `quoted_messages` on both rows (duplicate text on MP even with 2 rows)
- 3+ rows for one user intent
- AR before CC in `id` order when both submitted same turn

For local mock runs, `status=pending` is normal (n8n off) — do not fail classification repro on `status` alone.

